# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-

SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İDGAM ÇEŞİTLERİ GENEL TABLOSU (MAHRİÇ VE SIFAT İLİŞKİSİ — KK.9.2.6)</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="45" width="210" height="110" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="125" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">1. İDGAM-I MİSLEYN</text>\n  <text x="125" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">Aynı İki Harf (Mahreç = Sıfat)</text>\n  <text x="125" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#1d4ed8">• Meal-Gunne (م، ن): لَكُمْ مَا</text>\n  <text x="125" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#1d4ed8">• Bila-Gunne (Diğerleri):</text>\n  <text x="125" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">اِضْرِبْ بِعَصَاكَ · رَبِحَتْ تِجَارَتُهُمْ</text>\n  <rect x="245" y="45" width="210" height="110" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">2. İDGAM-I MÜTECANİSEYN</text>\n  <text x="350" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">Mahreç Aynı, Sıfat Farklı (3 Grup)</text>\n  <text x="350" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#166534">• (ط - د - ت) → قَدْ تَبَيَّنَ / أَثْقَلَتْ دَعَوَا</text>\n  <text x="350" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#166534">• (ظ - ذ - ث) → إِذْ ظَلَمُوا / يَلْهَثْ ذٰلِكَ</text>\n  <text x="350" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">• (ب - م) → اِرْكَبْ مَعَنَا (Gunneli)</text>\n  <rect x="470" y="45" width="210" height="110" rx="10" fill="#fffbeb" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="575" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#b45309">3. İDGAM-I MÜTEKARİBEYN</text>\n  <text x="575" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">Mahreç ve Sıfat Birbirine Yakın</text>\n  <text x="575" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#78350f">• (ل - ر) → قُلْ رَبِّ · بَلْ رَفَعَهُ</text>\n  <text x="575" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#78350f">• (ق - ك) → أَلَمْ نَخْلُقْكُمْ</text>\n  <text x="575" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#b91c1c">(Sakin harf 2. harfe katılır)</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="168" width="660" height="76" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="192" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#7e22ce">4. İDGAM-I ŞEMSİYYE (ال + Şemsî Harf)</text>\n  <text x="350" y="216" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">Harf-i tariften (ال) sonra 14 şemsî harften biri gelirse lâm okunmaz: الرَّحْمٰنِ · الصِّرَاطَ · الضَّالِّينَ</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">VAKIF - İBTİDA KURALLARI VE SECAVEND (DURAK) İŞARETLERİ</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="45" width="320" height="195" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="180" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">BAŞLICA SECAVEND HARFLERİ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="94" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#b91c1c">• م (Vakf-ı Lâzım): Kesinlikle durulmalı (anlam bozulur).</text>\n  <text x="35" y="118" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">• ط (Vakf-ı Mutlak): Durmak evladır (cümle tamamlandı).</text>\n  <text x="35" y="142" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">• ج (Vakf-ı Câiz): Durmak da geçmek de caizdir.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="166" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">• ز / ص (Mücevvez / Murahhas): Geçmek daha iyidir.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="190" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#dc2626">• لا (Lâ): Durulmaz, geçilir (durulursa geriden alınır).</text>\n  <text x="35" y="214" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#7e22ce">• ∴ ∴ (Muânaka): Üç noktalardan yalnız birinde durulur.</text>\n  <rect x="360" y="45" width="320" height="195" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="520" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">KELİME SONUNDA VAKIF (DURUŞ) KURALLARI</text>\n  <text x="375" y="96" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">1. Üstün, Esre, Ötre ve İki Esre / İki Ötre:</text>\n  <text x="375" y="114" font-size="10.5" fill="#166534">Son harf cezimli (sükûnlu) okunarak durulur (نَسْتَعِينُ → نَسْتَعِينْ).</text>\n  <text x="375" y="140" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">2. İki Üstün (ـًـا):</text>\n  <text x="375" y="158" font-size="10.5" fill="#166534">Tek üstüne çevrilip bir elif uzatılır (هُدًى → هُدَى / عَلِيمًا → عَلِيمَا).</text>\n  <text x="375" y="184" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">3. Yuvarlak Te (ة / ـة):</text>\n  <text x="375" y="202" font-size="10.5" fill="#166534">Harekeli bakılmaksızın sakin \'he\' (هْ) olarak durulur (رَحْمَةٌ → رَحْمَهْ).</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">YÜZÜNDEN OKUMA: FATİHA SURESİ VE BAKARA SURESİ 1-5. AYETLER (KK.9.3.1)</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="45" width="320" height="195" rx="10" fill="#fffbeb" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="180" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#b45309">FATİHA SURESİ TECVİT ÖRNEKLERİ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="96" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">• الْحَمْدُ / الْعَالَمِينَ : İzhar-ı Kameriyye (ل okunur)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="120" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">• الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ / الصِّرَاطَ : İdgam-ı Şemsiyye</text>\n  <text x="35" y="144" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">• نَسْتَعِينُ / الْمُسْتَقِيمَ : Vakıfta Medd-i Ârız</text>\n  <text x="35" y="168" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">• أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ : İzhar (نْ + ع) ve İzhar-ı Şefevî</text>\n  <text x="35" y="192" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b91c1c">• وَلَا الضَّالِّينَ : Medd-i Lâzım (Kelime-i Müsakkal — 4 elif)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="216" font-size="10.5" fill="#78350f">• 7 ayettir, Mekke\'de inmiştir; Ümmü\'l-Kur\'ân denir.</text>\n  <rect x="360" y="45" width="320" height="195" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="520" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#7e22ce">BAKARA 1-5 (ELİF-LÂM-MÎM) TECVİT ANALİZİ</text>\n  <text x="375" y="96" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• الم : Hurûf-ı Mukattaa (Elif — Lâm [Lâzım] — Mîm)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="120" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• هُدًى لِلْمُتَّقِينَ : İdgam-ı Bila-Gunne (tenvin + ل)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="144" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• يُنْفِقُونَ / مِنْ قَبْلِكَ : İhfa (نْ + ف / ق)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="168" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• أُولٰئِكَ : Medd-i Muttasıl (Kırık hemze aynı kelimede)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="192" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• بِمَا أُنْزِلَ : Medd-i Munfasıl (Uzun hemze ayrı kelimede)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="216" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">• مِمَّا / هُدًى مِنْ رَبِّهِمْ : İdgam-ı Meal-Gunne &amp; Bila-Gunne</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
